  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project, targeting 590,000 affected people, provides food distribution of food packages and through soup kitchens, stregnthens logistics coordination and cooperation among humanitarian actors and provides shared ICT services (radio communications, data connectivity and charging stations) in one common operational hub, including rapid mobilization of expertise and equipment. The sectors of engagement are FSA, Logistics and ETC.</narrative>
  </description>
